SUMMARY:Paddling Pigeon River at Hartford
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n*We are paddling from Hartford on the P
 igeon River for 10 miles\, class I-II+.*\nYou must have all your own white
 water gear and kayaks with spray skirts OR sit-on-tops\; plus be skilled a
 t this level. Bring lunch. We will meet and carpool from Home Depot at exi
 t 44 in Candler because parking is minimal there. Please text me for more 
 info and details.\n828-279-1664 Susan
