SUMMARY:Labor Day with Jimmy Buffett Cover Band - It’s 5:00 Somewhere
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Hey y’all! It’s 5:00 somewhere!**
 \n\n**Come out to the beautiful Mills River Brewery and celebrate Labor Da
 y with Jimmy Buffet Cover Band. - It's 5 O'Clock Somewhere. Get a cold one
  in your hand and let your mind take you to Margaritaville. 12-3pm**\n\n**
 MRB will** **also have margarita specials**\n\n**Pull out your best Hawaii
 an shirt and come hang out with the Parrot heads**\n\n**I will be there ea
 rly to secure some tables. Look for the Meetup signs**\n\n**https://www.mi
 llsriverbrewingco.com/**\n\n**https://facebook.com/events/s/labor-day-w-ji
 mmy-buffett-cove/1089775590070774/**
